---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <div class="max-w-4xl w-full px-6 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 tracking-tight">Technical Services</h1>
    <p class="text-neutral-400 max-w-2xl mb-16 leading-relaxed">
      Professional audio engineering specializing in the precision and weight required for club-ready UK House, Tech House, and UKG.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="p-8 border border-neutral-800 rounded-lg bg-neutral-900/50 hover:border-neutral-600 transition duration-300">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Mixing</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-6">Complete balancing, EQ, dynamics, and spatial processing to ensure your stems translate flawlessly to any system.</p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-neutral-500 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>Vocal integration & processing</li>
          <li>Low-end management</li>
          <li>Analog & digital summing</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 border border-neutral-800 rounded-lg bg-neutral-900/50 hover:border-neutral-600 transition duration-300">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Mastering</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-6">The final polish. Optimizing loudness, stereo width, and frequency balance to meet strict streaming and club standards.</p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-neutral-500 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>Loudness optimization (LUFS)</li>
          <li>Dynamic range control</li>
          <li>Format delivery (WAV, MP3)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>